  "label": "User projected onto the female gender symbol representing the group of people who deserve the listed rights",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material 'female_gender_symbol', which serves as a symbolic representation of the group (women) to whom the rights mentioned in the text are being asserted. The meme implicitly invites the user to identify with or empathize with this group by framing the rights as fundamental and deserved, thereby projecting the user's perspective onto the symbol and its associated message.",
